<section class="section">
  <div class="content">
    <h2 class="accent-heading">Our mission</h2>
    <p>Businesses collaborate through data — every contract includes a data transfer clause. We're on a mission to make B2B data transfer seamless and secure, while offering visibility and control to both sides of the transaction.</p>
    <p>We are committed to streamlining data transfer as much as possible. For example, we automatically extract relevant entities from contracts to create a client profile and to suggest compliance tests.</p>
    <p>Have a data transfer workflow to discuss? <a href="mailto:contact@generalfolders.com?subject=Data%20transfer%20use%20cases">Let's discuss</a> if General Folders can help.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-cream">
  <div class="content">
    <h2 class="accent-heading">Our story</h2>
    <p>The name <em>General Folders</em> draws inspiration from industry giants like GE and GM. The term <em>folders</em> is a nod to the role of folders in the management of data in computers.</p>
    <p>Our origins trace back to an apartment in Hayes Valley. After touring a number of WeWork locations, we've settled at SDSU to join Techstars.</p>
    <p>We have the privilege of being supported by investors who are experienced in building leading infrastructure, B2B SaaS, and influential companies.</p>
  </div>
</section>

